Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le09ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<p>You are never too old to reinvent yourself. You often hear people lamenting about the past saying if only I had studied harder, I could have been a doctor, or I would have climbed the corporate ladder by now  if I had only taken a chance that time, or I would have been happy if I had stayed with so and so.</p>\n<p>I'm here to tell you folks that living in the past is harmful because it keeps you trapped in a world that no longer exists and does not allow you to move forward. </p>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le09ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<p>What people don't realize is that change is good. It may be painful at first, seem radical, perhaps even  frightening, but change provides an important aspect that people need: personal growth. </p>\n<p>Change leads to opportunities and experiences; change enables people to become learners and most importantly, change ensures that life stays interesting.</p>\n<p>However, it is important to make goals so change doesn't sneak up on you.<br/>\nHere are a few for my near future goals that I will share with you. Please repeat!<br/>", "id": 2, "time": "28000", "image": "engenn9le09ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<p>In five years,<br/>\nI will have learned from my mistakes and not dwelt on them. I will never say if only I had done this, then I would have been that. <br/>\nI will have sought out new experiences and new opportunities.<br/>\nI will have embraced change no matter how scary.<br/>\nI will not be working at a job I do not enjoy.<br/>\nI will be  learning at every moment of every day.</p>\n<p>Because you are never too old  ... to change.\n</p>", "id": 3, "time": "62000", "image": "engenn9le09ob05re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le09ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le09ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}